      "delta": "man were followed by a much sharper comeback. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "It was not simply sustained possession dominance"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": ", the passing share became almost even, but Fran"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "ce made their attacks count: Mbappé scored the p"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "enalty and then the equaliser. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "The changes coincided with France becoming more "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "dangerous, rather than proving they caused it. "
    },
